  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb1e380f10ccfd95037e742",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下场竞赛来临前，打算怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad870105e8331346fbb5865f200d66a0322266c3363dd5d1e527a6cb7e9a718",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c53570c45a89036a8b337ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a154fdc222d14cdd7a454871",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你在竞赛前好像默念了些什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d91d0fb3df35a6c0f9219143ef65469741010fdf3362b932146e3a01c118bb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166d3dc2d932089a6d534b89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的目光都集中在你的精彩表现上呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "515138b19e0e701bebb40418a0150f691296abfdfdf4609a0f5cc772998e40f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc524b2d39d9c76f7338ebed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d9484660aa9d08215a9e7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问致胜关键是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99bc62e29330fa24ded2717da2ea26d66745fd0e4da36cb75f03eaf0d201faeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50531530386416238f70157b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「白色雷电」……的表现，还能继续期待吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "150ff6806b852379e562d2eb5969c70d4d3067aa8a3393e0018f83cece9af528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1faa5115c775e5ae5c369a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的对手说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aeb4cfb691231007ae78fa8cccf6cca67a6fdeb4a8e1d326c5ceaedf5337834",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70344f6c97be89d3f8f5a4fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有特别注意哪位决赛时的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d87f6885dd99f1ac2f95c0f9265b852e851a76b1df3d5dd1d9877cb788dabd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ca4636c82c300bdf136aa3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛前有做些什么来祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3f925d00357a8663971a655bb115703222336f2c0cf3b0b7a3c5a1af4407c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca41bddee57d55fbe05b656",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会想将这次的胜利传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3aacf7bd22d81aedb86e65ffa6085109bbf8dbd7b49e803fc91b716666e2f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e407cee9d5151382f0e0be5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃哪种特殊的拉面来庆祝胜利？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e9dbdc5cd49140f57207b362ddf42373f95a4bad9524df1dae8ce9a55409cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c307e9bd4c37306f06b502d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好像很喜欢吃香蕉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28259137bccb4c5039f3cab1b271cbfb35e658ae91d2bce54b9d425930e78233",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b84d54c8e50dcba36aff0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4120d78fbf1092e6b2fafd181fece9e0af0ec5b78238248d9a4228d438d3c77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6523fc6c64fbb6fc78ae980",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛中让眼镜不会掉下来的秘诀是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff27cbc7ce4f3cedc6abf5bf80407ec83ea0e35e60e81beddd52847f5df6f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1f8a0f59c1ac0180935318",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于这次的竞赛，有什么话想对妹妹说？",
      "source_fingerprint": "549ac9b606078c25dbf0d7c127dae9589b2e7461820ce853643ec0bf2de5509d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1c512e8d537c5d6c435a84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会有更激烈的战况吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54192323b34dd03631c7adf492e0fbd97767cc9c5f670cd065dbb161487fccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f50c4899af87fdeef6d0ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对下场比赛，你现在的状态如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083137408c9fa8073bfb8dbed5b8376520717be4d0776270e13367f40a0d8d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca5cc3da262925c684d879ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得决赛的胜算有多少……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36bbb197db1329cc40aed505c3c2cea7f2d2644ae2a30b008613c958d2572d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8955da248b84768059d425b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请直白地告诉我们，获胜的原因是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37952da99db907b3cd5d5212b8d1f61abc28842a3ef4d6389d6b653d27e38b85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce532890f7714971d4b0c7f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了什么样的准备来面对下场比赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d4fa2e898a3d5b686c00b97a80c208998f7ca64e97d3e909ad0b2b7b2489a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5679e487c3e70bfa87ef6284",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "脑中已经有获得优胜时的印象了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e251e9e32f41c7c5d2084709545c95d817f23d9925171809e6ee906b0ba6f1d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90cfb28814b0c1638550a2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前会补充什么样的燃料？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54865f4e0412e46e314efe1cb704436be35bb8a17ca0eb7063577f4bc8b61a76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0f146cb3fc828dcd5e0ad7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好惊人的表现……难道你真的是赛博格？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f97cf01b36e72854e42f041fcdcf148b4da9a301fcea47e81f8d17682a0e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db4ab171e3395887d0c12e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请让我们拍一张庆祝胜利的特写！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b19c748b84e8896026cc4a7c8dab46959f4ea45dd50cf6370fe67518e6b4faf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edb97e933b6f92d1d986769",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同「超特急」般的表现太精彩了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328f722939c2093fa199533ad74fc83ff0f427aed3181f6c0cf513d7cfb16286",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18601ca60de567371732e84f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有预计会针对决赛来强化自己吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91c8299afd411ac423daaacf584107d22c2ccfb0b61bb8af0b59a47ea42f130",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05af3726889c045593f2c72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是场相当激烈的竞赛，会感到疲累吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a67709e660f842b043741daec8a8186a74793c14db36e0cbd2ae589727823c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993b2adfc25103e1f61c5e38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32610bcce81c51c76c2c3dde0f2756e73043920658f8d1a42093c69129a5d14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350d10e0ab0f8a3bb3dc4b72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是看了就令人为之兴奋的震撼表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16314c9b40caa07c537fdaf61b0ed2d2e821adca3d982f74f543dafba9ac93a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e439be51572094ec4b5ebe8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你为了大赛下了特别的工夫！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786f71f49445bef2c469d4ad7875c8eba7a99e37ada7b84d9060e52d05094bac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72605b4c1e9f73c16fd4d494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70724cf0f51fa4c7fe5ab657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是相当耀眼的精彩表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49463d42c532d51e5f057a654d3f329d6e43931a1de0a191d6d3f26d2711267",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f23092e9fce493f6e7eb98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛时似乎会遇到更强的对手喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "242583cf602fa044fbe1fc74fedbc71f67ac77d643e8d9a2fc34b70e0b0aa693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c79cd268bf4a33a2b1a60ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你刚才似乎跟观众席的人说了些什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b43e2c74ae055b31125d1c3e876c0a6c3eb9a3a955af61a5a278aea98c409c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e228f89f9465fa3302f011c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对看完比赛的后辈赛马娘说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe117e9a77668239d0ba68c7773b2ea3b63d211371e58c24b87497c22313458",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac591e965c567011cf16cf7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛时也能期待你的表现对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "322b3540860ca3ff963115fa1a84318df86fec4cef78756387bf0d6636883420",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa926f6c6fba48c59838c5e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问你是以什么样的心情面对竞赛呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6133b20bd3e3181212803df5b57a1e9cea595b36fbc5589ffc166b34b17e632d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdad24fceb6ae79500394676",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的致胜料理果然是会吃饭吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bae6f9927ac2b654356259a7e56fcfa1609e63956c9a9dcf27c54479e3614c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12195471b5302909607faf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以让我们拍一张获胜的纪念照吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c38d61352e60487369c3d567b0ade3fa6461668b0381448dbf6b6938af60ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a962fd9b633be43b203fa73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对决赛时的压力会很大吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b548b7412c5410c52bc6f937df33a1aabd8ada6f0f215cdfb07224da096a17bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47932605434fcef2c16cce1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对决赛的劲敌发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "074544c32f79f0321e54dacf6cdc398fad3c8cb22f4fea039e7e30b3bab79ebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e44e17a1f6f61aa39da369d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对于下场比赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fede3e3f600c7943b09f52e254b414d137badde58a6fbc81f60a2449102055a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259e2a908168c925c60c18a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宛如音速般身处异次元的表现耶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b8b300df879146eac3cb8b4c35119d350fd7ac6dbf0870cfeecf3d62d3a1b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40fad9b93c9be9ec0f9ce48a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向粉丝发表你的感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a70fc7e309deeab90c84b20a0c26f10a36695edf2a4c0d9644b68c80cb13791",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c784565f03cec674a19895",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请跟竞赛对手说些你的感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e952b6da26243abbce38d3c4623085056a2e9c5bff14255c3b23edfa9d0759cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40aedcaaf3e79e04d07bf285",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的表现也很优雅呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21551aeedef20da7af1948d4dd1aeb367b428388c16361342df7752697565dc7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee62de0c52fc7f886000d9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的表现十分耀眼呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eaf178f00ceaf61e67999f39241ed500187c3b089fca68a2ac0b07c9583837c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9fd503a6270d1d626bc807",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对决赛的抱负。",
